# NERV Headquarters Overview

NERV is a secret global organization tasked with defending Earth from entities known as Angels.
Their main base is located underground in Tokyo-3, beneath the Geofront.
Evangelions (EVA Units) are giant humanoid bio-mechanical weapons piloted by chosen individuals called “Children.”

Each Evangelion unit is synced with its pilot via a neural link, amplifying emotional and psychological states.
The synchronization rate between the pilot and the EVA determines combat effectiveness.
However, high sync ratios can endanger the pilot’s mind.

Commander Ikari (Gendo Ikari) leads NERV, following mysterious plans known as the Human Instrumentality Project.
Dr. Ritsuko Akagi oversees the technical and scientific aspects of the Evangelion project.

# Tokyo-3
Tokyo-3 is a fortified city capable of retracting buildings underground during Angel attacks.
Citizens are routinely evacuated to shelters, while the Evangelions engage on the surface.
